  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.165` to `4.1.166`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.165...application_builder_helpers/4.1.166)\n\n## What's Changed\n* docs: correct error propagation to the fault contract (#734 DOCS-NOTE) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/738\n* docs: correct help-width bounds contradiction (#733 DOCS-NOTE) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/739\n* fix(cli): add built-in parser for DirectoryInfo (Fixes #735) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/740\n* fix(cli): return 130 on external aborts at the host-success drain route (Fixes #737) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/741\n* fix(cli): keep populated sub-command subtrees when a parent registers later (Fixes #731) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/742\n* fix(cli): apply the default host logging policy before dependency hooks so documented overrides win (Fixes #732) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/743\n* docs: note help/version flags consumed by required valued options (#736 DOCS-NOTE) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/745\n* fix(cli): exclude reserved help/version tokens from the fallback value predicates (Fixes #744) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/747\n* docs: document cancellation precedence in the exit tables (#750 DOCS-NOTE) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/752\n* docs: correct the one-argument CommandAttribute named-form examples (#751 DOCS-NOTE) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/753\n* Bump AbsolutePathHelpers from 0.3.153 to 0.3.154 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/755\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20261017183540.d6fc728...build.20261020103236.301806f",
